+/**
+ * Run a command as a process of the host and wait for it.  Without the
+ * flags its standard streams are the interpreter's.
+ *
+ * @param argv   The program and its arguments (NULL-terminated).
+ * @param envp   The environment (NULL-terminated "name=value" strings).
+ * @param cwd    The current directory, or NULL.
+ * @param input  The input, with WASM_CMD_INPUT.
+ * @param inputLength Its length.
+ * @param flags  WASM_CMD_* flags.
